From 2b6a9d38113de70489ab6ed9178bfa859738ad76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Illescas Romero <illescas.daniel@protonmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 17:11:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/65] P2: foundations - bg_cod tuning table + debug HUD (2.0)

- game/bg_cod.h, game/bg_cod.c: codTuning_t, bg_codCvars[] single source of
  truth for all phase 2 cod_* cvars, BG_CodRegisterCvars/BG_CodUpdateCvars
  helpers. Compiled into both qagame and cgame (SP/Makefile Q3GOBJ_/Q3CGOBJ_,
  next to bg_pmove.o).
- game/bg_public.h: STAT_COD_ADS/SLIDE/FLAGS/SLIDE_SPEED/STAT_COD_STANCE after
  STAT_PLAYER_CLASS, COD_SF_SPRINTING bit, compile-time check that they stay
  inside ps->stats[MAX_STATS].
- game/g_main.c, cgame/cg_main.c: register/update the cod_* cvars from
  G_RegisterCvars/G_UpdateCvars and CG_RegisterCvars/CG_UpdateCvars.
- cgame/cg_cod.c (new): CG_CodDrawDebugHud() top-left overlay (cod_debugHud
  1/2) and CG_CodDump_f ("cod_dump" console command), registered in
  cg_consolecmds.c and hooked from CG_Draw2D next to cg_drawFPS.
- cgame/cg_local.h: include bg_cod.h, add cg.codDuckDuration (used by 2.2),
  prototypes for cg_cod.c.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
